{"parse": {"title": "LPdF-12", "pageid": 114327, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-11\" title=\"LPdF-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LPdF-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-13\" title=\"LPdF-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LPdF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A5.BD.E6.97.B6.E5.85.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"好时光\">好时光</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 好时光</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Moment of Peace</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>曾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>离<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>歌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>声<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>飘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>托<span class=\"color-value\"></span>斯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>卡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>纳<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 30510112</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>后来呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民Ⅰ：</div><div>那些寻宝者打开了密室，一定找到了晚祷会的遗物吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">书商：</div><div>很遗憾，除了几封书信、一个地址以外，里面什么也没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民Ⅱ：</div><div>什么都没有？那……那些小人呢？别告诉我那都是你胡诌的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">书商：</div><div>别着急，听我慢慢说。这些可怜的画师工匠们后来四散到不同的地方，默默无闻地干着一些谋生的活计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">书商：</div><div>他们获得了乌切洛慷慨分享的神奇颜料，将它用在了其他的湿壁画上，再附上各自专属的签名——没错，就是那些神秘的小人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">书商：</div><div>这，就是蜚声佛罗伦萨多年的“湿壁画之谜”始末！为此我雇佣了一群新的画师，还给我的新手抄本取了好听的名字——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">书商：</div><div><b>“翡冷翠之春”！</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群发出不满的嘘声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民Ⅰ：</div><div>啧，真没意思……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民Ⅱ：</div><div>名字也烂得像狗屎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">书商：</div><div>呃……没关系，我们处在一个遍地黄金的时代！根据我的绝密消息，现在已经有直通“东印度群岛”的航路了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>城市从不缺乏新奇的传闻与谈资。从遗失的圣物到失踪的艺术家，属于佛罗伦萨的奇迹从未停歇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许每一个在这里生活过的人，都将有幸成为这奇迹的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_01\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧闹声中，太阳已悄然西沉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-635120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-635120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-635120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>哈啾——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>我有个严肃的问题：等到了所谓的“印度群岛”，是不是就能摆脱这些恼人的商贩和吟游诗人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>很遗憾，人们对传说的渴望足以跨越一切地理和时空的界限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>想不到有关晚祷会的传说从头到尾都是假的。看来无论在什么时代，流言的传播都是个严肃的议题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我们最初也没有在意这个传闻，直到你的出现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>呃？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客望向远方低垂的云层，谨慎地斟酌着词句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>遗物并非我们寻找的全部。事实上，你看上去很像我们多年前遗失的一个“苹果”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我想无论是我们，还是圣殿骑士组织，都在有意对你进行一些观察。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>当然，后来发生的一切都证明你们完全不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>噢，我以为我们已经是无话不谈的朋友了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我将你们视为朋友，但正因为如此，我必须对此保持沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>那颗苹果很危险，它的出现预示着鲜血和战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>喔，听起来比我厉害多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>不必谦虚，你也掀起了不小的风浪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>没错，你是一只神奇的苹果！很可惜最后我也没能把你解剖，好好研究一下内部的构造。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>请在心中好好保留这份缺憾吧……啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>苏芙比小姐，你怎么突然出现在我后面？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>是你们走得太快了！我和维尔汀刚才在下边遇到了一个老爷爷，他说只要沿着亚诺河向西北方向走啊走，然后……然后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>总之最后就能抵达普拉托韦基奥了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>呃，你似乎略过了一些信息——不，是很多信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>放心吧，艾吉奥认得路。接下来只要把书信交给乌切洛先生，我们的任务就算圆满完成！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>和佛罗伦萨说再见吧，各位。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_03\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s01_cg_03.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s01_cg_03.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s01_cg_03.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>哇哦，好多红色呀～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是盛年的黄昏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玫瑰色的暮光顺着天空淌下，走过街巷，游过花窗，最后融进悠长的亚诺河中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>我说过了，这里有最好的视野！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>很漂亮。难怪您坚持要我们一同上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>当然！这是一个适合告别的地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>漫无边际的话语随风飘零，在金红的夕光里缓缓融化——这也是一个适合朋友们围坐在一起说悄悄话的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>……后来我和朋友们打听了一下，才知道普拉托韦基奥盛产一种很特别的矿物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>只要将它们收集起来，然后研磨、加热……砰！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>就会变成一种可以隐形的颜料！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>哦，难道是乌切洛先生使用的那种？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那封信里说，普拉托韦基奥是乌切洛出生的地方，或许这是他从家乡带去佛罗伦萨的特产吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>我想是的。这些矿物的粉末和当地的赤铁矿、粘土混合起来，可以合成很多不同的颜色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>其中最出名的，便是一种名为“佛罗伦萨红”的红色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>“佛罗伦萨红”……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_01\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一种既不刺目，也不轻浮的红。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它出现在老房子的屋顶、日落的河流，甚至是街边小店的幌子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于是有人说，佛罗伦萨是一座被红色浸染的城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我喜欢这个名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">一周后</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一路的颠簸终于迎来尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>终于……前面那栋小房子就是乌切洛先生的家了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在不远处，小小的农舍掩映在橄榄树的浓荫中，石墙在午后阳光的映照下泛起一层白光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女往前走了两步，又犹豫起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>他要是知道这封信的主人，比安卡已经死了很多年了，心里一定会很伤心吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>这么多年过去，乌切洛现在应该是位白发苍苍的老者了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>这个年纪的人最熟悉的，就是死亡与道别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说完，他轻轻拍了一下苏芙比的肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客上前一步，推开枝蔓缠绕的篱笆门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陌生女士：</div><div>呀！你们是从哪里冒出来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>花园里生机盎然，一位衣裙沾满颜料的女士独自站在阳光下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>冒昧打扰，女士。我是来自佛罗伦萨的艾吉奥·奥迪托雷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我们在寻找一位名叫保罗·乌切洛的画家，这里有一些文件画稿，以及一封疑似朋友写给他的信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陌生女士：</div><div>朋友……？很遗憾，我父亲没有朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>信上的署名是“比安卡”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陌生女士：</div><div>比安卡！那一定是给我的信。好了，就放在桌上吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>咦？可信上提到了神奇的玻璃、大教堂的壁画，所以我们认为这应该是交给乌切洛先生的信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女士像是突然想起了什么，乐不可支地笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-635401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陌生女士：</div><div>噗嗤。看来你们也被我骗了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>我来自我介绍一下吧——我叫安东尼娅·乌切洛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>恐怕也是你们在找的画家保罗·乌切洛。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_14\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>这样啊……原来比安卡也死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沾满颜料的手紧握着那一沓泛黄的信纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>那幅湿壁画是我们之间的最后一次合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>后来我父亲便死了，留下生病的母亲和一堆烂债。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>我从小就跟在父亲身边，雕刻、金匠、湿壁画……什么都做。可身为女性，我没有签署合同的资格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>于是我便离开佛罗伦萨，借我父亲的名字在乡下讨生活。一些之前的老主顾们念及旧情，愿意替我隐瞒，把委托交给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>哦，原来你就是他们说的那个冒牌货！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安东尼娅瞪了一下眼前这位冒失的画家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>我确实受了父亲风格的影响，但那都是我早年的作品。现在我可远不止于此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>不不不……在我看来，画家的心应该像一面镜子，能如实呈现出摆在面前所有物体的形象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>从这个角度来看，你的父亲无疑技高一筹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>收起你们那套陈词滥调吧！我可不买账。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>你说画家的心该是镜子？那我告诉你，画家的心应该是一个透镜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>它先是将外界的景象折射、转化，再重新构建出画家心中的世界，而不是一味模仿复制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>哦，我还从未听过这样有趣的理论！虽说有些古怪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>口说无凭。你们等着，我找找我最近的画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她“噌”地站起身，在桌上的纸堆里翻找起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>她看上去是位很有精神的女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>嗯，她让我想起我的妹妹。她们都是经历了很多，却依然坚强的女性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>唉，要是她对绘画的理解能更深入一些，我们应该能成为好朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阳光透过窗棂洒进屋内，光斑在古老的木地板上快活地跳跃着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灶台锅子里发出“咕噜咕噜”的响声，屋内弥漫着清新的药草香气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战乱、瘟疫、贫困、亲人的离去……属于这一代人们的记忆，如今藏匿在每一块古旧木板的缝隙中，也扎根在每一株向阳的花木里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安东尼娅便是在这片宁静的栖息地里，过着属于自己的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>刚才你说……你叫什么名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安东尼娅不知何时又折返回来，手里拿着一张泛黄的画稿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她直直看向艾吉奥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>你是奥迪托雷家的男孩吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>是的。你认识我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>难怪我总觉得你看起来很眼熟……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>你的母亲，玛利亚·奥迪托雷曾经资助过我的父亲一段时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>父亲在她的资助下，进行了许多对透视与光学的研究，又将这些知识教给了我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>原来如此……然后你又将这些知识用在了壁画里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安东尼娅调皮地眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>万事万物皆有联系，不是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>建筑师、赞助人、工匠和画师、刺客和异乡人……哦，一道清晰的链条！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某忽然获得了前所未有的参与感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>父亲不止一次提到过你和你的家人……他非常感激你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>抱歉，如果母亲没有中断资助，或许你也不用出来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安东尼娅摇了摇头，神色坦然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>我们不是贪心的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>你母亲曾委托他为你们画了一张全家福，还记得吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>全家福……？我似乎没有什么印象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>唉，可能你那时候还小吧。后来你家发生了那样的变故，全家福也搁置了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走到艾吉奥跟前，将手中的画稿交给他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>我手里只有这一张草图，但我想你可能需要它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼娅：</div><div>就当是送信的谢礼吧。谢谢你们大老远从佛罗伦萨赶来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾吉奥接过画稿，颤抖着轻轻展开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-312310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-312310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-312310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一张泛黄的画稿，上面潦草地画着奥迪托雷家的全部成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-312313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-312313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-312313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>父亲、母亲，还有费代里科、克劳迪娅、彼得鲁乔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-635111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-635111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-635111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>哎呀，这确实是十七岁的你，我可以作证！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少年艾吉奥懒洋洋地靠在角落里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那时候他只有十七岁，无忧无虑，一心憧憬着外面自由的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其余家庭成员并不介意他的心不在焉。他们背靠托斯卡纳晴朗的天空，露出灿烂的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>喔，看上去是个好天气，而画家记录下了这个珍贵的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>握住画稿的手轻轻颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>是啊……没有比这更好的时候了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_27.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_27\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_27\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-s01_cg_27.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_27.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-s01_cg_27.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_27.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-s01_cg_27.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_27.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他似乎听到遥远而明亮的笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那声音轻得像风，它掠过砖红的屋顶，穿越漫长的时光，最后轻盈地从泛黄的画纸中钻出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我们的生活很美好，兄弟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没错。但愿它永远不用改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也愿它永远不会改变我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>后来他们似乎还说了些什么。格拉巴酒、银行，亦或是克里斯蒂娜？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记忆随风散开，轻柔而温暖，最后消融在午后的光晕中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他只模糊地记起，那时他们笑得像孩童一般纯粹，世界也为他们悄悄停下脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——这是奥迪托雷家最好的时光。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LPdF-12"}}